# Titles: type as the whole show. A title card, a held silence while the
# brain stalls, a visible correction. Nothing is drawn.

look night
style whisper size=s ink=dim enter=fade
style card size=xxl weight=bold face=display enter=slam by=all

scene open solo tense
say whisper | a short film about
wait
say card | WAITING
cam push slow
wait 2

scene hold stack lines=3 calm slow
cam rest
say a1 | Hold on.
#! stall 5
say a2 | I was thinking.
say a3 | I am always right.
wait 2
correct a3 | I am *sometimes* right.
wait 2

scene end solo
say card ink=accent | fin
wait 2

scene moved layout=caption
look paper
card c2 | Words stay in their card
say x60 in=c2 | Which colour for the fox?
say x62 choice in=c2 | Orange
say x64 choice in=c2 | Grey
move x62 21,72
move x60 24,58
wait 2
